sequenceDiagram
  actor Operator
  participant UI as Swing Main
  participant Sim as Simulation
  participant Index as HashTable / Heap / BST
  participant Graph as Graph
  Operator->>UI: Select incident and suggest unit
  UI->>Sim: recommend(incidentId)
  Sim->>Index: lookup incident and scan compatible units
  Sim->>Graph: dijkstra(vehicle, incident)
  Graph-->>Sim: route cost
  Sim-->>UI: candidate
  Operator->>UI: Confirm assignment
  UI->>Sim: assign(incident, vehicle)
  Sim->>Index: validate and remove from FIFO
  Sim-->>UI: status EN_ROUTE
  Operator->>UI: Resolve
  UI->>Sim: resolve(incidentId)
  Sim->>Index: remove from hash/BST/heap
  Sim-->>UI: points and updated counts
